  "question": {
    "text": "The correct order of the atomic radii of $\\mathrm{C}, \\mathrm{Cs}, \\mathrm{Al},$ and $\\mathrm{S}$ is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}  < \\mathrm{S} < \\mathrm{A} 1 < \\mathrm{Cs}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{S}  < \\mathrm{C} < \\mathrm{Cs} < \\mathrm{Al}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{S}  < \\mathrm{C} < \\mathrm{Al} < \\mathrm{Cs}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}  < \\mathrm{S} < \\mathrm{Cs} < \\mathrm{Al}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "On going down the group, size increases while going from left to right in a period size decreases, so order is\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{C}  < \\mathrm{S} < \\mathrm{Al} < \\mathrm{Cs}$"
  }
}